<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202306/chatgpt-self-questioning-event-planning/images/chatgpt-self-questioning-event-planning-13.webp" width="1400" height="319" alt="https://www.books.com.tw/products/0011004216" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
